  "source_review_notes": [
    "Every prior original case and decision remains at its authenticated immutable source checkpoint. Current rewritten records bind actual current source bytes and the exact finite producer edits; no original golden/contract predicate/case roster was changed.",
    "All six NG_VALUE_ACCESSOR source objects retain tagged16 multi-provider/forwardRef/class/decorator/selector/barrel identity. Own-line packed artifacts separately execute actual Angular node/forms registration and the original model/view/user/touched/disabled/reenabled/teardown predicates.",
    "Two new markForCheck calls use public constructor-supplied detector receivers: after menu embedded-view destruction and after terminal tab style writes before the existing completion output. The private readonly tab field binds the original third constructor argument.",
    "The original menu/dialog removed-import type receipts replay their exact authenticated source epoch only after current packed repairs are qualified. Mandatory current graph identities, source review evidence and both retained obligations stay raw. Full native/runtime/floor admission cannot consume the historical reader.",
    "The source-context owner now also invokes the role guard before returning mapped older metadata. The added late-metadata regression fails before that one-line fix; both final integrated probes reject all90mutations and both deliberately faulty verifier implementations."
  ],
